Krypton: Register isolated, profile-local Notes and Easel pages.

The trusted WebUI contains only the validated document bridge. Editors
are packed prebuilt and run only in an untrusted renderer. No npm work
runs in GN and no startup service or rendering-engine hook is added.
Reserve resources from the existing unused placeholder range so other
resource ranges retain their allocations.

